# [.work]: per-ticket worktrees, one per ticket — see AGENTS.md.
# A worktree is a full checkout with a .git FILE, so `git add .` would stage
# each as an embedded-repo gitlink: 160 bytes naming one sha, no error, and a
# clone of master inherits empty directories pointing into nowhere.
.work/
